// The bakery (P3, owner A17: "its own tile with a road through it, so it chains like houses").
// A straight road from edge 0 to edge 3 with the bakery north of it (runtime -z), its shop front to
// the road (yaw 90 turns its +x front to +z), and a gravel forecourt beside it that opens straight off
// the asphalt (bakery_pad, scripts/blender/kit/bakery_pad.py). The road graph runs through the
// junction "j" with a 3 m spur to the "bakery" Shop node at the forecourt's mouth, so the forecourt
// belongs to the parking paths (as house_cluster's driveway does). The spur's lanes drive within the
// 20 deg/tick rule at every rotation (2 m was too short for the inner corner's arc).
//
// Parking (PRD §7.1): `park-<n>` is spot n, at the pad's `anchor-park-<n>` socket (hex-core
// data_validator checks they match). A visitor noses in north (`enter`): up the spur from the node's
// inbound lane when it comes from the west, or turning right off the through lane short of the node
// when it comes from the east. It leaves with a three-point turn: it reverses back to the mouth and
// swings its tail onto the through road, east to leave west (`back`) or west to leave east
// (`back_alt`), ending at the cusp, then drives forward onto the outbound lane. The paths keep a
// 5.4 x 2.0 m car clear of the shop, the forecourt edging and hedge, the cut kerbs either side of
// the mouth and the other spot (hex-sim tests/parking.rs). A shop owns no cars.
(
    id: "bakery",
    biome: Grass,
    base: "meadow_base",
    edges: (
        (kind: Road, lane: Some((offset: 0.0, width: 6.0))),
        (kind: Grass),
        (kind: Grass),
        (kind: Road, lane: Some((offset: 0.0, width: 6.0))),
        (kind: Grass),
        (kind: Grass),
    ),
    center: Some("bakery_pad"),
    props: (
        hero: [
            (piece: "bakery_shop", at: (-4.1, -8.5), yaw_deg: 90.0),
        ],
    ),
    nodes: [
        (id: "j", at: (2.0, 0.0)),
        (id: "bakery", at: (2.0, -3.0), destination: Some(Shop)),
    ],
    networks: [
        (kind: Road, from: Edge(0), to: Node("j")),
        (kind: Road, from: Node("j"), to: Edge(3)),
        (kind: Road, from: Node("j"), to: Node("bakery")),
    ],
    parking: [
        (
            id: "park-0", house: 0, node: "bakery", at: (1.8, -8.8), yaw_deg: 270.0,
            enter: [(at: (1.9, -4.6), yaw_deg: 270.0)],
            back: [(at: (1.8, -3.8), yaw_deg: 270.0), (at: (4.3, -1.4), yaw_deg: 200.0)],
            back_alt: [(at: (1.8, -3.8), yaw_deg: 270.0), (at: (-0.7, -1.4), yaw_deg: 340.0)],
        ),
        (
            id: "park-1", house: 0, node: "bakery", at: (4.5, -8.6), yaw_deg: 270.0,
            enter: [(at: (3.8, -3.8), yaw_deg: 282.0)],
            back: [(at: (4.5, -3.3), yaw_deg: 270.0), (at: (7.1, -0.8), yaw_deg: 205.0)],
            back_alt: [(at: (3.8, -3.0), yaw_deg: 270.0), (at: (1.6, 0.6), yaw_deg: 330.0)],
        ),
    ],
    agents: [],
)
